"The QE input below reuses the tetragonal-phase example from "
":doc:`stability` without changes. \\  In a Quloud Job, replace the Job's "
"``QuloudJob.scf.in`` with the example below. The setting \\  "
"``calculation = 'relax'`` optimizes only the atomic positions while "
"keeping the lattice fixed."

