#: ../../BaTiO3/geometry-optimization.rst:424
msgid ""
"この結果は、BaTiO₃ の強誘電性が Ti-O 相対変位に由来するという既知の物理描像と整合的です。\\ 特に、Ti "
"原子が強誘電方向へ変位し、酸素八面体が非対称に歪むという特徴は、\\ 実験構造および第一原理研究で示されてきた BaTiO₃ "
"の強誘電構造とよく対応しています。"
msgstr ""
"This result is consistent with the established picture in which "
"ferroelectricity in BaTiO₃ arises from relative Ti–O displacements. \\  "
"In particular, displacement of Ti in the ferroelectric direction and "
"asymmetric distortion of the oxygen octahedron \\  agree well with the "
"ferroelectric structure of BaTiO₃ found in experiments and first-"
"principles studies."

#: ../../BaTiO3/geometry-optimization.rst:431
msgid "機械学習ポテンシャルによる構造最適化"
msgstr "Geometry Optimization with Machine-Learning Potentials"

#: ../../BaTiO3/geometry-optimization.rst:436
msgid ""
"機械学習原子間ポテンシャル計算では、CHGNet、SevenNet、FairChem を用いました。\\ OpenMX "
"と同様に、格子定数と格子角は固定し、原子位置のみを緩和しました。\\ ただし、機械学習ポテンシャル計算で用いた固定格子は OpenMX "
"の固定格子とわずかに異なります。"
msgstr ""
"We used CHGNet, SevenNet, and FairChem for the machine-learning "
"interatomic potential calculations. \\  As in OpenMX, we fixed the "
"lattice constants and angles and relaxed only the atomic positions. \\  "
"However, the fixed lattice for the machine-learning potential "
"calculations differed slightly from the one used in OpenMX."

#: ../../BaTiO3/geometry-optimization.rst:440
msgid "OpenMX と機械学習ポテンシャルの固定格子比較"
msgstr "Fixed lattice parameters for OpenMX and the machine-learning potentials"

