#: ../../BaTiO3/geometry-optimization.rst:562
msgid ""
"Ti を囲む酸素八面体のひずみを、c 軸に沿う 2 本の頂点方向（apical）の結合と、面内（equatorial）の結合で比較します。\\ "
"頂点方向の短い結合と長い結合の差は、Ti–O 配置の非対称性を表します。"
msgstr ""
"We compare distortions of the oxygen octahedron around Ti using the two "
"apical bonds along the c axis and the in-plane equatorial bonds. \\  The "
"difference between the short and long apical bonds measures the asymmetry"
" of the Ti–O arrangement."

