#: ../../BaTiO3/geometry-optimization.rst:596
msgid ""
"CHGNet、SevenNet、FairChem は、equatorial Ti-O 距離については OpenMX に近い値を与えます。\\ "
"しかし、apical Ti-O の結合差は OpenMX より大きく、\\ "
"機械学習ポテンシャルが酸素八面体の極性歪みを強めに予測していることが分かります。"
msgstr ""
"CHGNet, SevenNet, and FairChem gave equatorial Ti–O bond lengths close to"
" those from OpenMX. \\  However, the apical Ti–O bond length difference "
"was larger than in OpenMX, \\  showing that the machine-learning "
"potentials predict a stronger polar distortion of the oxygen octahedron."

#: ../../BaTiO3/geometry-optimization.rst:601
msgid "考察と比較"
msgstr "Discussion and Comparison"

#: ../../BaTiO3/geometry-optimization.rst:604
msgid "計算手法の役割"
msgstr "Role of Each Calculation Method"

#: ../../BaTiO3/geometry-optimization.rst:606
msgid ""
"BaTiO₃ のように微小な原子変位と電子構造が強く結び付いた強誘電体では、電子状態を解く DFT 計算を基準にします。\\ "
"機械学習原子間ポテンシャルは DFT より速く構造を緩和できるので、多数の構造のスクリーニングや分子動力学計算に向きます。\\ "
"一方で、学習データやモデルの表現能力によって\\ 特定の構造歪みを過大または過小に評価することがあります（技術ノートの\\ "
"`機械学習原子間ポテンシャル <https://technical-notes.quemix.com/md/mlip.html>`__）。\\ "
"今回も、3 モデルとも頂点方向の Ti–O 結合の差を OpenMX より大きく与えました。"
msgstr ""
"For ferroelectrics like BaTiO₃, where small atomic displacements are "
"closely tied to the electronic structure, we use DFT calculations that "
"solve for the electronic states as the reference. \\  Machine-learning "
"interatomic potentials relax structures faster than DFT, making them "
"suitable for screening many structures or running molecular dynamics. \\"
"  However, depending on the training data and what the model can "
"represent, \\  they may overestimate or underestimate particular "
"structural distortions (see the Technical Notes on \\  `machine-learning "
"interatomic potentials <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/md/mlip.html>`__). \\  Here, all three models gave a "
"larger difference between the apical Ti–O bond lengths than OpenMX."

#: ../../BaTiO3/geometry-optimization.rst:613
msgid "OpenMX と既往研究の対応"
msgstr "Consistency of the OpenMX Results with Previous Studies"

#: ../../BaTiO3/geometry-optimization.rst:615
msgid ""
"OpenMX の結果では、Ti の中心からのずれが残り、酸素副格子が主に緩和しました。\\ これは、BaTiO₃ の強誘電性が Ti-O "
"相対変位および酸素八面体の歪みによって特徴づけられるという\\ 既往研究（実験の正方晶構造 :sup:`[1]`、ソフトモードの中性子散乱 "
":sup:`[2]`、Ti 3d–O 2p 混成の第一原理研究 :sup:`[3]`）の理解と整合します。\\ したがって、本 OpenMX "
"計算で得られた Ti-O 相対変位と酸素八面体の非対称性は、\\ BaTiO₃ の強誘電構造として妥当な結果です。"
msgstr ""
"In the OpenMX results, Ti remained off-center and most of the relaxation "
"occurred in the oxygen sublattice. \\  This is consistent with the "
"picture from previous studies that relative Ti–O displacements and "
"distortions of the oxygen octahedra \\  characterize ferroelectricity in "
"BaTiO₃ (the experimental tetragonal structure :sup:`[1]`, neutron "
"scattering studies of soft modes :sup:`[2]`, and first-principles studies"
" of Ti 3d–O 2p hybridization :sup:`[3]`). \\  The relative Ti–O "
"displacements and oxygen octahedron asymmetry from these OpenMX "
"calculations \\  are therefore plausible for the ferroelectric structure "
"of BaTiO₃."

#: ../../BaTiO3/geometry-optimization.rst:622
msgid "まとめ"
msgstr "Summary"

#: ../../BaTiO3/geometry-optimization.rst:624
msgid ""
"OpenMX は、Ti の極性変位を保ったまま酸素副格子を緩和し、既往研究と整合する構造を与えました。\\ "
"今回の固定格子での構造最適化では、この結果を DFT の基準としました。"
msgstr ""
"OpenMX relaxed the oxygen sublattice while preserving Ti's polar "
"displacement and gave a structure consistent with previous studies. \\  "
"We used this result as the DFT reference for the fixed-lattice geometry "
"optimization."

#: ../../BaTiO3/geometry-optimization.rst:627
msgid ""
"FairChem と SevenNet は正方晶の極性構造を再現しており、構造を素早く見積もるのに使えます。\\ 頂点方向（apical）の "
"Ti–O 結合の長さの差は、どちらも OpenMX より大きくなりました。"
msgstr ""
"FairChem and SevenNet reproduced the tetragonal polar structure and can "
"provide quick estimates of the structure. \\  For both, the difference "
"between the apical Ti–O bond lengths was larger than in OpenMX."

#: ../../BaTiO3/geometry-optimization.rst:630
msgid ""
"CHGNet は z 方向だけを緩和する設定で正方晶の面内配置を保ちました。\\ Ba 基準の内部変位は、FairChem や SevenNet "
"よりも OpenMX との差が大きくなりました。"
msgstr ""
"With relaxation allowed only along z, CHGNet preserved the tetragonal in-"
"plane arrangement. \\  Its internal displacements relative to Ba differed"
" more from OpenMX than did those from FairChem or SevenNet."

#: ../../BaTiO3/geometry-optimization.rst:633
msgid ""
"モデル間の比較は、今回の初期構造と拘束条件での内部変位と結合距離に限られます。\\ 原子変位や結合距離を定量的に議論するには、OpenMX などの"
" DFT 計算で確認します。"
msgstr ""
"The comparison among models covers only the internal displacements and "
"bond lengths for the initial structure and constraints used here. \\  "
"Quantitative discussion of atomic displacements or bond lengths requires "
"verification with DFT calculations such as OpenMX."

